        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The University shall contribute up to four hundred ninety four dollars and seventy-six cents ($494.76) per unit member per month toward the cost of health benefits. The University contribution shall increase effective July 1, 2004, by up to twenty-eight (28) per cent to $634.06, effective July 1, 2005, by up to ten (10) per cent to $697.47, and effective July 1, 2006 by up to ten (10) per cent to $767.33. There shall be no further increases to the University's defined contribution during the term of this agreement, or any extensions thereto. Coverage shall not be altered without the agreement of the parties in a labor/management meeting. In the event the cost of the benefits as prorated among participants in a particular plan exceeds the University's defined contribution, such cost in excess of the University's defined contribution shall be borne by unit members.",
            "block_bbox": [
                317,
                378,
