        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The “Traditional” Plan is the health plan in place for unit members and other participating employees on the date of this Agreement. Effective January 1, 2004, the Plan Year will be transitioned from calendar year to fiscal year. January - June 2004 will be a six-month “benefit year,” with deductible and out-of-pocket maximums set at half of current levels. All other coverage levels shall remain the same. Health care and dependent care flexible spending accounts (FSAs) will remain on a calendar year basis until December 31, 2004. Effective January 1, 2005, the Plan Year for FSAs will be transitioned from calendar year to fiscal year. January – June 2005 will be a six-month “benefit year,” for flexible spending accounts with these accounts adjusted to half of their applicable annual limits.",
